NODE id=matrix/gateway/internal/rates.rateTable kind=var
  digest=b3:cb5e6b72535e9c7285ed030dc9dc8c565ff24d0351cbe417948993050fa6898b file=gateway/internal/rates/rates.go range=192:298 lang=go exported=false byte_range=9857:15615
  sig=[]rates.Rate
  doc=rateTable is the immutable v3 rate card. Adding a model OR repricing\nREQUIRES bumping RateTableVersion to keep historical ledger rows\nreplayable. Order is documentation only; the lookup is a map (see init).\n\nPAX values = USD target / 11.43 (1 PAX = $11.43, v3 reference). The\n`≈ $X` USD targets are the invariant; bake in real provider rates\nbefore GA and re-derive.
